# `FLOWCHART-ROLE-KEYWORDS`: the flowchart role vocabulary. `process`, `decision` and
# `terminator` are `node` with a `role` field; the SHAPE is DERIVED from the
# role (process->box, decision->diamond, terminator->rounded) and appears in
# the model as the resolved value, exactly as `node`'s materialized default
# does. The role shares the node id namespace and is addressable by edge,
# rank and pin like any node.
figdown 0.1 flowchart
title "Roles"
terminator start "Begin"
process     step "Do the work"
decision    gate "Continue?"
terminator  stop "End"
flow down
rank step,gate
edge start -> step
edge step -> gate
edge gate -[yes]-> stop
edge gate -[no]-> step
layout
pin start at=(10,10)
pin step width=90 height=30
